  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0115_dcf3e03156ca.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 191px;\" /></p><p>The length of the perpendicular from centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &nbsp;to the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Length of intercept <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>64</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Sum of the square of lengths of intercepts</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munderover><mi>&#931;</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><munderover><mi>&#931;</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>320</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><munderov